@startuml Pay_A_Bill_Sequence
actor Customer
participant "PayLink API" as API
participant "Fraud Checks" as Fraud
participant "Fee Calculator" as Fees
participant Wallet
participant "Payment Processing" as Payment
participant "Biller Integration" as Adapter
participant "External Biller" as Biller
participant Notifications as Notify

Customer -> API: Confirm bill payment
API -> Fraud: Validate account and velocity
Fraud --> API: Pass / Reject
alt Rejected
    API --> Customer: Rejection reason
else Passed
    API -> Fees: Calculate fee and total
    Fees --> API: Fee and total
    API -> Wallet: Hold funds
    Wallet --> API: Hold confirmed
    API -> Payment: Create payment (Initiated)
    Payment -> Adapter: Submit bill payment
    Adapter -> Biller: Request payment
    alt Biller confirms
        Biller --> Adapter: Success
        Adapter --> Payment: Completed result
        Payment -> Wallet: Finalize held funds
        Payment -> Notify: Send success SMS and push
        Notify --> Customer: Payment completed
    else Biller declines
        Biller --> Adapter: Failure
        Adapter --> Payment: Failed result
        Payment -> Wallet: Release held funds
        Payment -> Notify: Send failure SMS and push
        Notify --> Customer: Payment failed
    else Timeout
        Adapter --> Payment: Timeout / Unknown
        Payment -> Payment: Keep Unknown; retry status query
    end
end
@enduml
